        "quote": "The number of copies of the administratively approved recorded minor plat, as specified in the Planning Department’s administrative procedures, shall be submitted to the Planning Director within 10 days after the plat has been recorded with the Register of Deeds. The Planning Director will distribute the recorded copies to the various government agencies and local utility companies. No building permit shall be issued by the City until the recorded copies of the approved minor plat are on file with the Planning Director. (Ord. 18558 § 8, 1-24-06. Code 1995 § 134-47.)",
